  "changed_since_previous": "The new version unconditionally logs the 'Resolved data directory' line on every startup instead of only printing it when the canonical path differs from the configured path, ensuring log parsers can rely on the line being present.",
  "card": "Logs the symlink-resolved canonical data directory during node startup immediately after the configured path. This makes saved debug.log files reflect the physical storage directory used when running bitcoind via symlinked paths. The author notes this assists benchmarking across different storage media when wrapper scripts prevent modifying startup flags. No dependencies.",
